aphen Gmelina arborea und = अनन्ता, आपराजिता, कट्फल, काकोदुम्बरिका, कृष्णा, जीवन्ती, दन्ती, नीली, प्रसारिणी, बला, रास्ना, वचा, शमी, श्वेतदूर्वा, सारिवाविशेष und हरिद्रा.\n — c〉 ein best. Metrum.\n — d〉 das 7ten bewegliche Karaṇa; "},{"t":"cite","s":"Vgl. 2","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". करण 4〉n〉.\n — e〉 der zweite lunar Tag Ind. "},{"t":"cite","s":"St. 10,297","q":"St"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n — f〉 eine Form der Durgā "},{"t":"cite","s":"VP. 5,1,83","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":".\n — g〉 N. pr.\n — α〉 einer Gottheit, auch einer buddhistischen.\n — β〉 einer Śakti HEMĀDRI 1,198,5.\n — γ〉 der Dākṣāyaṇī in Bhadreśvara.\n — δ〉 einer Vidyādharī.\n — ε〉 einer Surāṅganā Ind. "},{"t":"cite","s":"St. 15,232","q":"St"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n — ζ〉 einer Tochter der Surabhi, einer Gattin des Vasudeva und verschiedener anderer Frauen HEM. "},{"t":"cite","s":"PAR. 11,130","q":"PAR"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n — η〉 verschiedener Flüsse.\n — ϑ〉 eines Sees HEMĀDRI 1,352,15. Vgl. भद्रसरस्.\n— 4〉 n.\n — a〉 Glück, Heil, Gutes, Annehmlichkeit. Auch. Pl. भद्रमुपलाः möge es euch, Steine, wohlgehen! भद्रं ते und भद्रं वः als Höflichkeitsformeln mitten in die Rede eingeschoben.\n — b〉 Gold.\n — c〉 Eisen oder Stahl. []\n — d〉 eine Cyperus-Art.\n — e〉 eine best. Art zu sitzen.\n — f〉 eine best. Karaṇa; vgl. 2. करण 4〉n〉.\n — g〉 Name verschiedener Sāman ĀRṢ. BR.\n — h〉 ein best. mystisches Zeichen AGNI-"},{"t":"cite","s":"P. 29,28","q":"P"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk, Thomas Malten on 20241207. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/PWK/issues/111."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"भद्र 2〉g〉β〉 vgl. ZACH. Beitr."}]},{"n":3,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"भद्र "},{"t":"cite","s":"IV. 5","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". n. ein best. Theil des Hauses DAMAYANTĪ"},{"t":"cite","s":"K. 258","q":"K"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]},{"id":"BadrA","headword":"भद्रा","headword_slp1":"BadrA","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"1. भद्रा꣫ Adj. und Subst. f. s. u. भद्र꣫."}]},{"n":2,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s